From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 18:09:50 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: mt6351: clear the headphone output STBENH at power-down

Headphone power-up sets bit 13 of AUDDEC_ANA_CON1, and nothing clears it
again. On the Gemini PDA the idle headphone output then picks up a burst
of noise every 30 s while Wi-Fi is associated, from the first stream on,
and until the next reboot.

Clear the bit once the output is off. The next power-up sets it again.
---
 sound/soc/codecs/mt6351.c | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/sound/soc/codecs/mt6351.c b/sound/soc/codecs/mt6351.c
index 976770c..51ee0da 100644
--- a/sound/soc/codecs/mt6351.c
+++ b/sound/soc/codecs/mt6351.c
@@ -829,6 +829,11 @@ static int mt_hp_event(struct snd_soc_dapm_widget *w,
 				   MT6351_AUDDEC_ANA_CON2,
 				   0x0001,
 				   0x0000);
+		/* disable output STBENH, or the idle output picks up noise */
+		regmap_update_bits(cmpnt->regmap,
+				   MT6351_AUDDEC_ANA_CON1,
+				   0x2000,
+				   0x0000);
 
 		/* apply volume setting */
 		hp_gain_ramp_set(cmpnt, HP_GAIN_RESTORE);
